              "value": "=Dear {{ $json['First Name'] }},<br><br>Thank you for visiting {{ $json['Clinic Name'] }} today for your {{ $json['Appointment Type'] }} appointment with {{ $json['Dentist Name'] }}.<br><br>We hope everything went well! If you have a moment, we'd really appreciate hearing about your experience. Your feedback helps us improve and helps other patients find quality dental care.<br><br>Leave a quick review here: {{ $json['Google Review URL'] }}<br><br>It only takes 30 seconds, and it means a lot to our team.<br><br>Thank you,<br>The {{ $json['Clinic Name'] }} Team<br>{{ $json['Clinic Phone'] }}",
